{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses a presentation."}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"DismissAction","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/init(action:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" environment value to get the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of this structure for a given "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to perform the dismissal. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can create a button that calls the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct SheetContents: View {","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Done\") {","            dismiss()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you present the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SheetContents"},{"type":"text","text":" view in a sheet, the user can dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sheet by tapping or clicking the sheet’s button:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            SheetContents()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Be sure that you define the action in the appropriate environment."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, don’t reorganize the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DetailView"},{"type":"text","text":" in the example above"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that it creates the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" property and calls it from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/sheet(item:onDismiss:content:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss \/\/ Applies to DetailView.","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            Button(\"Done\") {","                dismiss() \/\/ Fails to dismiss the sheet.","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you do this, the sheet fails to dismiss because the action applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the environment where you declared it, which is that of the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, rather than the sheet. In fact, if you’ve presented the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationView"},{"type":"text","text":", the dismissal pops the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the navigation stack."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dismiss action has no effect on a view that isn’t currently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. If you need to query whether OpenSwiftUI is currently presenting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a view, read the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues\/isPresented"},{"type":"text","text":" environment value."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/s9EscapableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Escapable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissAction/init(action:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction\/init(action:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?)","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"init(action:)","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/init(action:)"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissAction":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","title":"DismissAction","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An action that dismisses a presentation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissAction/callAsFunction()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"callAsFunction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"identifier